    "unique_mechanism": {
      "name": "The Coherence Protocol",
      "description": "A tri-phasic approach combining Mindful Motion (Active), Somatic Release (Passive), and Cognitive Reframing (Mental) to resolve the dissonance between physical pain and emotional desire.",
      "core_philosophy": "The body holds the score, but movement rewrites the game. We do not push through pain; we listen to it until it dissolves.",
      "origin_story": "Born from a personal battle with fibromyalgia, where traditional 'push-harder' fitness failed and only gentle, coherent movement provided the cure."
    },
